      "statement": "The async /upload endpoint accepts country as a Form field alongside thread_id, forwards it to run_agent, and offloads both the blocking chain.invoke and run_agent calls to asyncio.to_thread to avoid stalling the event loop; its frontend contract is FormData with the file plus thread_id and country.",
